### HF-37 — CRUD de Receitas (REC). Base: http://localhost:8081/api/v1
@base = http://localhost:8081/api/v1
@user = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001

### Cenário: criação bem-sucedida (201)
POST {{base}}/income
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "user_id": "{{user}}",
  "description": "Salário junho",
  "amount": "5000.00",
  "date": "2026-06-05",
  "competence": "2026-06",
  "type": "SALARY",
  "recurrent": false
}

### Cenário: campo obrigatório ausente — REC-01 (400 MISSING_REQUIRED_FIELD)
POST {{base}}/income
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "user_id": "{{user}}",
  "amount": "100.00",
  "date": "2026-06-05",
  "competence": "2026-06",
  "type": "SALARY"
}

### Cenário: amount inválido — REC-02 (400 INVALID_AMOUNT)
POST {{base}}/income
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "user_id": "{{user}}",
  "description": "Salário",
  "amount": "-10.00",
  "date": "2026-06-05",
  "competence": "2026-06",
  "type": "SALARY"
}

### Cenário: type inválido — REC-01 (400 INVALID_INCOME_TYPE)
POST {{base}}/income
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "user_id": "{{user}}",
  "description": "Bônus",
  "amount": "100.00",
  "date": "2026-06-05",
  "competence": "2026-06",
  "type": "CRYPTO"
}

### Cenário: competence inválida — REC-01 (400 INVALID_COMPETENCE)
POST {{base}}/income
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "user_id": "{{user}}",
  "description": "Salário",
  "amount": "100.00",
  "date": "2026-06-05",
  "competence": "2026/06",
  "type": "SALARY"
}

### Cenário: listagem por usuário/competência com total_income (200)
GET {{base}}/income?user_id={{user}}&competence=2026-06

### Cenário: buscar por ID (200) — substitua :id
GET {{base}}/income/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Cenário: ID inexistente (404 INCOME_NOT_FOUND)
GET {{base}}/income/11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111

### Cenário: editar (200) — substitua :id
PUT {{base}}/income/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "Salário corrigido",
  "amount": "5200.00"
}

### Cenário: soft delete (204) — substitua :id
DELETE {{base}}/income/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
